<div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,.1);padding:1.2rem;"><p style="font-family:'DM Mono';color:var(--gold);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;">Market Expansion</p><p style="color:var(--light-grey);font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.7;">Enter new Nevada markets or geographies with a validated offer.</p></div>
